  "name": "Malaysia Championships",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The Malaysia Championships are part of the Championship Series run by Pokémon Asia. In 2023 they gave out Brilliant Stars' Ultra Ball with a 2023 Malaysia Championships stamp, in plain, Staff, Top 8 and Champion versions. The English-speaking regions of the program, such as Singapore, Malaysia and the Philippines, used the same card as the International Championships, while regions with localized cards got other trophy cards.\n\nThe 2024 event gave Scarlet & Violet's Arven and a holo Paldea Evolved Chien-Pao ex, each with a Malaysia Championships stamp."
  },
